      "incumbent": false,
      "summary": "Jamee Decio is the Democratic nominee for Indiana's 2nd Congressional District, having won the May 5, 2026 primary. She is an Elkhart native, attorney, and former legislative aide who was among the first women admitted to the University of Notre Dame and later earned her law degree from Notre Dame Law School. Decio previously worked as an Elkhart County deputy prosecutor and in private practice before becoming a screenwriter and member of the Writers Guild of America. Her campaign focuses on affordability, strengthening local industry, and protecting democratic institutions.",
